  "question": {
    "text": "The height of any point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> above the surface of earth is equal to diameter of earth. The value of acceleration due to gravity at point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> will be : (Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo></math>acceleration due to gravity at the surface of earth)."
  },
